{"agent":"bugfix4","data":{"budget":"","claim":"queue_ahead treats a shared glob as exclusive, so re-stating a shared glob the item already holds is refused as 'queued behind' an earlier waiter","falsifier":"the same update minus the shared glob is accepted","item":"fix-B-update-queue-ignores-shared-globs","mechanism":"shared_globs overlap nothing (conflicts filters them); queue_ahead uses raw globs_overlap, which does not","probe":"test_rereating_a_shared_glob_is_not_queued_behind_a_waiter FAILS on main (queued behind Q1) and PASSES after queue_ahead uses conflicts(globs, w[globs], shared_globs(cfg))","probe_output":"","question":"Why is update --globs refused as 'queued behind sw-cedefaults' when it only re-states a shared glob?","sources":[],"verdict":"CONFIRMED"},"id":"eea5fd51eeb3abe9689170bb4","kind":"research.recorded","lamport":143013,"schema":1,"subject":"R53fc8ecf79","ts":"2026-11-05T21:04:00.827221Z"}
